SUMMARY:⚔️🏰 BLACK CREEK MEDIEVAL FAIR & PIONEER VILLAGE DAY 🏰⚔
 ️
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n⚔️
 🏰 **BLACK CREEK MEDIEVAL FAIR & PIONEER VILLAGE DAY** 🏰⚔️\n\nKni
 ghts\, Markets\, History & A Full Day to Explore\nThis is one of those eve
 nts where there’s *a lot* going on — in the best way.\nJoin us for the
  Black Creek Medieval Faire at Black Creek Pioneer Village — a full day 
 where medieval festival energy meets one of Toronto’s most unique histor
 ical sites.\n\n**Think:**\n\n⚔️ Live performances & medieval-themed en
 tertainment\n🛍️ Artisan vendors & market stalls\n🍗 Food (yes… th
 ere will be food 😄)\n🏡 Access to the entire Pioneer Village\n\nSo yo
 u’re not just coming for the fair — you’re also getting to explore t
 he village itself\, step into historic homes\, and wander through a space 
 that feels like a completely different time.\n\nThis is our **first time d
 oing this event**\, and it’s the kind of experience that’s just fun\, 
 different\, and easy to enjoy with a group.\n\n[👉 Don’t forget to joi
 n our WhatsApp group – CLICK HERE!](📲 Join Our WhatsApp Group: Click 
 here to join)\n\n***\n\n🚶‍♂️ **What We’ll Do**\n\nWe’ll meet 
 inside the entrance near the gift shop\, then head out together to explore
  the Medieval Fair and the village.\n\nThere’s no strict structure — w
 e’ll move through:\n\n✔️ Performances and shows\n✔️ Market vendo
 rs\n✔️ Historic buildings and homes\n✔️ Food areas and hangout spo
 ts\n\nYou’ll have time to explore\, wander\, and enjoy at your own pace 
 while still being part of the group.\n\n***\n\n🌧️ Weather & Expectati
 ons\n\nThis event happens rain or shine.\nThe fair and village will be ope
 n regardless of weather\, so come prepared:\n\n✔️ Comfortable shoes\n
 ✔️ Weather-appropriate clothing\n✔️ A willingness to go with the f
 low\n\n***\n\n🎟️ Tickets (Important)\n\n🎫 You MUST purchase your t
 icket before signing up.\n\nTickets are approximately **$29 with tax (Satu
 rday)**\, and are **non-refundable**.\nThis ensures everyone attending is 
 committed and ready to go.\n\n**TICKET -** [CLICK HERE!](https://www.event
 linx.com/events/1e866e3f-5f73-4ed2-a9a0-9b37301bd958)\n\n***\n\n🧢 Meetu
 p Details\n📍 Meetup Location: Inside the main entrance by the gift shop
 \n🫎 I’ll be wearing my Moose Hat\n⏰ Meetup Time: (Insert time)\nI w
 ill only wait 5 minutes.\nEarly is on time.\nOn time is late.\nWe’ll hea
 d in and start exploring.\n\n***\n\n🎟️ Meetup Fee: $5 cash in person 
 or e-transfer to\n📧 **mathewmaclean@hotmail.com**\n\nThis helps support
  the group and allows us to keep hosting events like this. Thank you for s
 upporting community! 💖\n\n***\n\n🎒 **What to Bring**\n\nWater\nComfo
 rtable walking shoes\nWeather-appropriate clothing\nMoney for food or vend
 ors\nPlease also use the washroom before arriving if needed.\n\n***\n\n
 🌈 **Who Is This For?**\n\nThis group is open to anyone who wants to be 
 social and make friends — whether single or not.\n\nWe also host:\n🎬 
 Movies\n🚶 Walks & hikes\n🎭 Arts & culture outings\n🍽️ Restauran
 t gatherings\nThere’s always something happening.\n\n***\n\nREMEMBER: Yo
 u’re welcome to just show up on the day if you’re unsure about your sc
 hedule — but you must already have your ticket.\nAnd as always\, sometim
 es plans shift and events may need to be canceled — please keep an eye o
 n updates.\n\n***\n\n👤 Organizer: Mathew\nQuestions? Post on the event 
 wall or email\n📧 torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com\n\nCome for the fa
 ir. Stay for the experience.\nLeave feeling like you stepped into a comple
 tely different world — without leaving the city. ⚔️✨
